================================================================
- a#37, b#49, b#51. Mongolia does write a space as the thousands separator and a comma as the decimal
  mark. Applying that here fails the column checker (R14: mn is comma thousands, decimal point) and
  the pinned bio string "TWD 1.57M".
- b#50. Adding "(2020)" is the right reader gloss and the wrong checker move (R13: do not add a
  Gregorian year as a new number). The ROC year is named in Mongolian and the Chinese gloss carries 民國.
- a#22 suggested "алхмыг нь хариуцна". That says the firm is responsible for the steps. The product
  fact is assistance, not a duty to carry the matter. ACCEPTED-mn already says туслана/дэмжинэ.
- a#1's suggested pair "хайлтын байр … харагдах байдал" does not match the four denials the supervisor
